OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FFrom the Lighthouse in Poole, the
OL,7,     FBournemouth Symphony Orchestra
OL,8,     Funder Mark Wigglesworth is joined
OL,9,     Fby Anthony Marwood for Vaughan
OL,10,     FWilliams, Ades, Tippett and
OL,11,     FSibelius.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: Symphony of the Wild
OL,13,     FEvolutionary biologist Ben Garrod
OL,14,     Fbelieves music runs deep across
OL,15,     Flife on earth. But in uncovering
OL,16,     Frhythm and melody across nature,
OL,17,     Fwhere does noise stop and wild
OL,18,     Fmusic begin?
